**/backups
**/*.sqlite*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
sites
examples
docs
tests
deploy
*.md

# Rush working files. The store under common/temp is rebuilt inside the image;
# the lockfile the build needs lives in common/config/rush and comes through.
common/temp
common/deploy

# A project's content model is read from its repository at runtime, never baked
# in. Keeping the example project out of the build context makes that
# structural: no future COPY can put a customer's collections in the image.
# Rush, though, must see every manifest rush.json lists — the three below are
# manifests only, never content.
!sites/micacms/package.json
!examples/company-site/package.json
!tests/browser/package.json
